# Block Diagram – Smart Road Cleaning Rover

## System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Battery / Power Supply] --> B[ESP32 Controller]
    B --> C[Motor Driver]
    C --> D[Drive Motors and Wheels]
    B --> E[Cleaning Motor]
    E --> F[Rotating Brush / Roller]
    B --> G[Ultrasonic Sensor]
    G --> B
    B --> H[Bluetooth / Wi-Fi Control]
``` 

## Description

- The battery supplies power to the rover.
- The ESP32 acts as the main controller.
- The motor driver controls the drive motors.
- The cleaning motor rotates the brush or roller to collect waste.
- The ultrasonic sensor detects nearby obstacles.
- Bluetooth or Wi-Fi can be used for wireless control.

*Note: This is a conceptual block diagram. The actual wiring depends on the components used.*
